---
// PalafitDonationOptions.astro
---

<section id="donar" class="pipod-donation-section">
  <div class="pipod-container">
    
    <div class="pipod-header-wrapper">
      <h2 class="pipod-section-heading">Elige tu forma de donar</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="pipod-impact-grid">
      
      <div class="pipod-impact-card tech-highlight">
        <div class="pipod-card-header">
          <i class="bi bi-laptop"></i>
          <span class="pipod-card-tag">TECNOLOGÍA</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pipod-card-content">
          <h3>Equipos para Pipod</h3>
          <p>Trae computadoras o tecnología en desuso. Nosotros la restauramos para que la escuela de Don Gu tenga herramientas digitales.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pipod-card-footer-left">
          <span class="pipod-badge-action">Coordinar entrega <i class="bi bi-box-seam"></i></span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="https://vaki.co/" target="_blank" class="pipod-impact-card">
        <div class="pipod-card-header">
          <i class="bi bi-rocket-takeoff"></i>
          <span class="pipod-card-tag">FINANCIERO</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pipod-card-content">
          <h3>VakiSponsor</h3>
          <p>Apoya con suscripciones mensuales o aportes únicos. Cada peso sostiene el arriendo y las meriendas de los niños.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pipod-card-footer-left">
          <span class="pipod-badge-action">Ir a la Vaki <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="https://wa.me/573124813094" class="pipod-impact-card">
        <div class="pipod-card-header">
          <i class="bi bi-person-heart"></i>
          <span class="pipod-card-tag">DIRECTO</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pipod-card-content">
          <h3>Contacto Humano</h3>
          <p>Habla con nosotros para donaciones especiales, voluntariado o para solicitar tu certificado de donación.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pipod-card-footer-left">
          <span class="pipod-badge-action">Escribir al WhatsApp <i class="bi bi-whatsapp"></i></span>
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@700;800&family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;500&family=PT+Mono&display=swap');

  .pipod-donation-section {
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 80px 0;
    border-top: 0.85px solid #000;
  }

  .pipod-container {
    max-width: 1440px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 80px;
    @media (max-width: 768px) { padding: 0 25px; }
  }

  .pipod-header-wrapper {
    text-align: left;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .pipod-section-heading {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .pipod-impact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 40px;

    @media (max-width: 1024px) { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .pipod-impact-card {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: #000;
    border: 0.85px solid #000;
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 45px;
    background: #fff;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);

    &:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
      border-color: #3A506B;
    }

    &.tech-highlight {
      background: #F9F9F9;
    }

    .pipod-card-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      i { font-size: 2rem; color: #000; }
    }

    .pipod-card-tag {
      font-family: 'PT Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #888;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    }

    h3 {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    p {
      font-family: 'Noto Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #444;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      flex-grow: 1;
    }

    .pipod-card-footer-left {
      text-align: left;
      .pipod-badge-action {
        font-family: 'PT Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #3A506B;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
